{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2022-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1669852800, "end_date": 1670457599, "month_true_total": 1663, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:04:13 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "128128203", "author": {"steamid": "76561198839500703", "personaname": "BT-Dubs", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198839500703/", "num_games_owned": 90, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 1315, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 765, "last_played": 1724002162, "avatar": "50f93314b12d9e7272b4ab00fb8130822cc0d8a4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Hundreds of hours on playstation. But played on PC a bit. After work, you want to make a biomech style ninja, and kill things in an endless survival. Warframe\n\nDo you want some of the best movement systems i've every played in a game? Warframe.\n\nDo you want to have 50+ classes on one account which drastically differ from each other. Warframe.\n\nYou'll hear people complain about the grind, but its only as grindy as you want it to be. Unlike many other looter shooters or MMO's, there's no rush to endgame. \nThe game doesn't start at endgame, the game starts when you start playing. \n\nAnd it's wonderful.", "timestamp_created": 1670454489, "timestamp_updated": 1670454489, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "128126246", "author": {"steamid": "76561199173139002", "personaname": "Gynxu", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199173139002/", "num_games_owned": 60, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 32441, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 282, "playtime_a